<p>Your hounds can now survive for up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> turns after their hit points are reduced below 1.  While in this state they deal 50% less damage but are immune to additional damage.</p><p>Command Blink will now regenerate your hounds for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">28, 38, 46, 52, 58</acronym> life per turn and increase their global speed by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">15%, 27%, 35%, 40%, 44%</acronym> for five turns.  Hounds below 1 life when this effect occurs will have the bonuses doubled.</p><p>When you learn this talent, your hounds gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43%</acronym> stun, blind, confusion, and pin resistance.</p><p>The regeneration scales with your Spellpower.</p>